<span><small>add <code>--simple</code> to the very end, and AI generator will try to generate simpler designs.</small></span>
<br/><span><small>add <code>--ar width:height</code> to your description. default 1:1.<a href="guide-aspect-ratio-flag-tattoo-prompt.html" style="color: #9c9f24">learn about aspect ratios</a>.</small></span>

